[Interactables]
Bread
name : Bread
hit : You smash the piece of bread to mush.
interact : You bite a chunk out of the bread.
interact command : eat

Ale
name : Ale
hit : You smack the glass off the table.
interact : You take a big sip of ale.
interact command : drink

Apple
name : Apple
hit : You hit the apple but it hits you back.
interact : You take a bite of the apple.
interact command : eat